{"headword":"נָדִיב","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>adj.</strong> and <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.8\">Is 32:8</a></sup> <strong>inclined, generous, noble</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.5\">Is 32:5</a> + 6 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְדִיב</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:5\" href=\"/Exodus.35.5\">Ex 35:5</a> + 2 times; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְדִיבָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:14\" href=\"/Psalms.51.14\">ψ 51:14</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְדִיבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.2\">Is 13:2</a> + 9 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְדִיבֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:18\" href=\"/Numbers.21.18\">Nu 21:18</a> + 2 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְדִיבֵמוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:12\" href=\"/Psalms.83.12\">ψ 83:12</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>incited, inclined, willing</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נְדִיב לֵב</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:5\" href=\"/Exodus.35.5\">Ex 35:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:22\" href=\"/Exodus.35.22\">22</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:31\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.31\">2 Ch 29:31</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, נָדַב\" href=\"/BDB,_נָדַב\", dir=\"rtl\">נָדַב</a> <strong>Qal</strong>), <span dir=\"rtl\">נָדִיב בְחָכְמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.21\">28:21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּחַ נְדִיבָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:14\" href=\"/Psalms.51.14\">ψ 51:14</a> <em>a willing spirit</em>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>noble, princely</em>, in rank <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.8\">1 S 2:8</a> (poem), <a data-ref=\"Job 12:21\" href=\"/Job.12.21\">Jb 12:21</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:40\" href=\"/Psalms.107.40\">ψ 107:40</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 34:18\" href=\"/Job.34.18\">Jb 34:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.16\">Pr 8:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 47:10\" href